#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/state_functors_and_simulation.md:1
msgid "State, Functors, and Simulation"
msgstr "状态、Functors 与模拟"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/state_functors_and_simulation.md:3
msgid "The executable RELIC lifecycle has one state owner and one simulation owner. `StateManager` validates and commits tensors. Scientific Functors calculate `UpdateItem` objects. `RELICSimulator` orders Functors, supplies time and device context, commits each group call's updates through `StateManager`, and wraps all group commits of a step in one accepted-step transaction."
msgstr "可执行的 RELIC 生命周期只有一个状态所有者和一个模拟所有者。`StateManager` 验证并提交张量。科学 Functor 计算 `UpdateItem` 对象。`RELICSimulator` 对 Functor 排序，提供时间与设备上下文，通过 `StateManager` 对每次组调用的更新进行状态提交，并将一步中所有组的状态提交包装在一个已接受步事务中。"

