#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/state_functors_and_simulation.md:130
msgid "Use `get_state(clone=False)` only for performance-critical read-only access. The canonical simulation update path is `apply_updates()`, not direct mutation of tensors returned by the manager. `checkpoint()`/`restore()` are full in-memory snapshots used by the adaptive retry and embedded in the durable simulator checkpoint; the accepted-step rollback uses `create_transaction_savepoint()`/`restore_transaction_savepoint()`. Neither is a second file format or an independently durable persistence system."
msgstr "仅在性能关键的只读访问中使用 `get_state(clone=False)`。规范的模拟更新路径是 `apply_updates()`，而不是直接修改管理器返回的张量。`checkpoint()`/`restore()` 是完整的内存快照，供自适应重试使用，并嵌入持久化的模拟器检查点中；已接受步的回滚使用 `create_transaction_savepoint()`/`restore_transaction_savepoint()`。二者都不是第二种文件格式，也不是独立的持久化系统。"

